        "density": 0.01658,
        "chars": 357,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 119.08
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        141,
        1294,
        1275,
        1440
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the New York City Charter in recognition of the need for comprehensive health planning provides that the Health Services Administrator shall have the power and duty to prepare intermediate and long range programs designed to meet the needs of the City with regard to health services, and to establish priorities among them;",
